            </note>
            <note corresp="#d354-f2" n="2" xml:id="d354-f2-content">
                <p>Later on May 18, Lodge sent a telegram to
                    the Department confirming the contents of this telephone conversation. (Telegram
                    996 from USUN; Department of State, Central
                    Files, 684A.86/5–1856)</p>
            </note>
